<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/024c688a94d5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The sophisticated nature of the AI-powered investment scams also became prominent in a latest Spanish police bust, who arrested six people for being a part of a scam that stole over $20 million from at least 208 victims." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/04cb79d3ced5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The individual in the video was not the company's CEO, but rather a fictitious, computer-generated avatar programmed to recite a script." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0988a1588427> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Fraudsters can use generative technology to steal a person's identity." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/107dac855359> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Next-Gen AI Scam Clones Broker Exante, Opens JPMorgan Account to Dupe U.S. Victim" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/16118d280691> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A generative model can simultaneously send thousands of fake fraud warnings." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/18357fe76f29> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4836] In 2024, United Kingdom-based Arup --- an engineering consulting firm --- lost around $25 million after fraudsters tricked a staff member into transferring funds during a live video conference." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/18cf31385ffd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Scammers have become so sophisticated that even traditional bank accounts are within their reach. In one such case, scammers opened a JPMorgan Chase bank account and scammed at least one victim in the United States through a clone of Exante, a brokerage firm that does not even offer services in that country." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1f61cbe22a8b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6516] The firms allegedly lured prospective investors with wild claims of 'using AI to trade crypto assets' when in fact they used multi-level marketing ploys to attract new investors. [6516] The individual in the video was not the company's CEO, but rather a fictitious, computer-generated avatar programmed to recite a script." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/32d2f680f26c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "AI has empowered fraudsters to sidestep anti-spoofing checks and voice verification, allowing them to produce counterfeit identification and financial documents remarkably quickly." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/422d5de0fdd8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The US Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) also issued an advisory stating that \"AI is making it increasingly easier for fraudsters to create convincing scams.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/49b8b146c913> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The firms allegedly lured prospective investors with wild claims of \"using AI to trade crypto assets\" when in fact they used multi-level marketing ploys to attract new investors." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4c721b17aa54> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4836] Liveness detection uses real-time biometrics to determine whether the person in front of the camera is real and matches the account holder's ID." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4f2509573be6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "There are tools that can generate deepfake videos using the faces and voices of celebrities and even politicians to lure victims." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/56f09c74d0ba> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"Last year we all saw the democratization of AI as a productivity tool, and since then, AI-powered scams now make up nearly half of all fraud attempts,\" says Adam Ennamli, chief risk officer at General Bank of Canada." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4411" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5a735e3fbcbc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4412] Just over half (53%) of businesses in the U.S. and U.K. have been targets of a financial scam powered by \"deepfake\" technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4412" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6219be00cc43> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "AI is used in half of bank scams. Here’s what you need to watch out for" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4411" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/751bb9be0e79> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4818] With AI-generated passports, deepfakes and websites, fraudsters are running sophisticated, large-scale, ultra-realistic scams." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7d5999d29ed7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4836] Deepfakes use generator and discriminator algorithms to create a digital duplicate and evaluate realism, enabling them to convincingly mimic someone's facial features and voice." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7d5d6ca0acd0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "How Scammers Use AI in Banking Fraud" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7fd5b54daf90> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Elizabeth Smith, a spokesperson with the DFPI, told Forbes in an email that the agency's enforcement team determined that the avatar was created on Synthesia.io, and is dubbed \"Gary.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8706b8f5f299> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The 2021 Identity and Fraud Trends report shows roughly 33% of false positives Equifax sees are synthetic identities." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8713e2ea0679> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The banking industry is feeling the impact, with more than a quarter of bank customers experiencing fraudulent activity on their accounts in the past year, according to a study by J.D. Power." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4411" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/87a329bdc57d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Liveness detection uses real-time biometrics to determine whether the person in front of the camera is real and matches the account holder's ID." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/90e379ab60e2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4836] Financial institutions should tell customers to never share their MFA code." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/acac43786cb0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The scale of scam operations using deepfakes and AI tools can be seen in a recent investigation by the Organised Crime and Corruption Reporting Project (OCCRP), Swedish Television (SVT), and 30 other media partners." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/acb328005814> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "According to research from YouGov, 61% of victims attribute their vulnerability to data security breaches, while 60% cite a lack of awareness about different types of scams." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4411" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/af35550c3f4d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Just over half (53%) of businesses in the U.S. and U.K. have been targets of a financial scam powered by \"deepfake\" technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4412" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b43c8964b043> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "For instance, simple prompt engineering can force a generative model to reveal its true nature." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/beee753363a4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4412] In May, British engineering group Arup was in the spotlight after reports that scammers successfully siphoned $25 million from the company by using deepfake technology to pose as the organization's CFO. [4836] In 2024, United Kingdom-based Arup --- an engineering consulting firm --- lost around $25 million after fraudsters tricked a staff member into transferring funds during a live video conference." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4836" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c3a36455d58b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Use strong, unique passwords for all financial accounts and enable two-factor authentication where possible." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4411" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c41240ba0706> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Alleged Crypto Scammers Used AI And Actors As Faux CEOs" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d4ca8a9b0fe5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Victims were not selected randomly; instead, algorithms selected those whose profiles matched the cybercriminals' searches." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d6eaed441c8d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Last December, the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) also warned the public about criminals using generative AI on a large scale." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4818" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e41dbc6f2018> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4412] Generative AI could enable fraud losses to reach $40 billion in the U.S. by 2027, Big Four accounting firm Deloitte said in a May report. [6516] In the 5-page order issued by the California Department of Financial Protection and Innovation (DFPI) that details allegations of the sale of unauthorized securities..." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4412" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e4dbc485f989> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Deepfake scams escalate, hitting 53% of businesses" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4412" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/Risk/64961ba9fe77> a airo:Risk ;
    rdfs:label "Risk of financial fraud using AI-generated deepfakes and synthetic identities" ;
    airo:confidenceScore "0.9"^^xsd:float ;
