<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/02e3b9e8f928> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Since the fraudsters were offering products under the oversight of the SEC and CFTC, Exante's compliance team filed complaints with both agencies, as well as the State of New York and FinCEN." ;
